WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:01.940
We have a voicemail number.

00:00:01.940 --> 00:00:04.540
That number is two one nine two David P..

00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:07.950
Here's a funny, kind of interesting but also
prescient voicemail.

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:11.849
This is from a foreigner who just doesn't
understand how Trump is able to get away with

00:00:11.849 --> 00:00:12.929
lies all the time.

00:00:12.929 --> 00:00:13.929
Take a listen.

00:00:13.929 --> 00:00:14.929
Hey, David.

00:00:14.929 --> 00:00:17.460
This is Andre calling from Wolfsburg, Germany.

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:19.869
Yes, I've got a question.

00:00:19.869 --> 00:00:26.419
Could you please explain to me why the media,
Barrack Obama, Joe Biden and the rest of the

00:00:26.419 --> 00:00:33.490
Democratic Party do not rip Trump apart for
the B.S. and the lies he keeps telling on

00:00:33.490 --> 00:00:34.930
a daily basis?

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:43.260
I mean, any of these lies and false allegations
which Trump has been spreading over the last

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:47.850
couple of weeks would have been political
suicide in Germany.

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:48.850
Yes.

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:54.860
I mean, to me, the media and the Democrats,
they seem like victims that are too afraid

00:00:54.860 --> 00:00:57.600
to stand up against the bully.

00:00:57.600 --> 00:00:58.860
What do you think about that?

00:00:58.860 --> 00:00:59.860
Yes.

00:00:59.860 --> 00:01:04.430
So listen, I understand the total bewilderment
around the world at what is going on.

00:01:04.430 --> 00:01:09.550
Trump is a laughing stock, and yet he doesn't
seem to sort of suffer the consequences.

00:01:09.550 --> 00:01:13.310
This is only partially because of Democrats
and it's only partially because of the media.

00:01:13.310 --> 00:01:18.370
I've talked before about how when Trump lies
at a press briefing and he gets called out

00:01:18.370 --> 00:01:22.760
on the lie, he will tell three more lies and
then move on to the next reporter.

00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:24.780
And it's very hard to control that.

00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:27.540
Or he will simply end the press briefing early.

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:31.890
And these things in the United States are
not proving to be political suicide.

00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:32.890
Why?

00:01:32.890 --> 00:01:37.570
Because you have such a partizan environment
that half the country doesn't care or half

00:01:37.570 --> 00:01:44.110
the country sees Trump leaving early from
a press briefing as a sign of power, or they

00:01:44.110 --> 00:01:45.880
simply believe everything he says.

00:01:45.880 --> 00:01:52.310
We have such a broken, critical, critical
thinking has broken in the United States.

00:01:52.310 --> 00:01:53.821
And so I get it.

00:01:53.821 --> 00:01:57.080
People you know, my family from Argentina,
my family that lives in France, my family

00:01:57.080 --> 00:01:59.740
that lives in Israel, they see what's going
on in this.

00:01:59.740 --> 00:02:00.740
What?

00:02:00.740 --> 00:02:01.990
How are people not just calling Trump out?

00:02:01.990 --> 00:02:04.770
And how is it not hurting him politically?

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:09.509
You have to understand the degree of ignorance
and partizanship that exists in the United

00:02:09.509 --> 00:02:11.579
States to really understand the answer to
that.

00:02:11.579 --> 00:02:13.160
And it is very, very ugly.

